-- a piece's stated reason, read from its text alone; kept beside the piece (<piece>/stated-<key>, the
-- key this definition has, which covers all it calls), so each piece's text is read for it once, and a
-- change to how it is read is a new key and never meets an answer kept by the old one
hy-stated-of : List Word → Sum Unit (List Word × List Word)
hy-stated-of p = hy-stated-last (hy-comment-lines (h-split #10 p))
